<title>UK: EIB sets 3.0 bln French franc five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 3.0 bln French franc five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FFR   BASE	 3M-PIBOR  MATURITY    12.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -12.5 BP  PAY DATE  S-20.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  99.91     FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    99.91</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    PAR/LUX   DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   **</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES   ** GENERAL WITH SPECIFICATIONS FOR FRANCE ONLY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
